AB  - For embodied AI agents to function effectively in XR environments, they must understand space, navigate within it, and converse and act in contextually appropriate ways. This work presents an XR agent system that integrates these capabilities. The proposed system constructs a virtual environment on top of the user's physical space, enabling the agent to converse with users in natural language and perform appropriate actions while maintaining awareness of spatial context. Through a unified loop where dialogue and motion share the same spatial state, consistency between the agent's utterances and actions is maintained. This work explores how spatially grounded embodied agents can perform natural interaction within personalized XR environments.
